    <bpmn:documentation>Status: OBSERVED_AND_TESTED_CURRENT. Source basis: Direct PTY observation of controlled choice editing; 65 shipped VHS scripts; full-editing contract; mutation-path audit and focused test evidence.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_Process_02_current_tui_edit_save">
